Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

The sockets_amxx.dll H9 shipped before, from the reTS AMX Mod X build (1.10.0-manual):
120320 bytes, SHA256 320CF09402EF815324D02D6281433C3E862C31DC98789FF048E22D4BF37E90DA,
kept as sockets_amxx.dll.bak_slots beside this file. To go back, copy that over sockets_amxx.dll.

On servers of 32 slots or fewer nothing changes: the tables are longer, and every loop and
bound in them still stops at the server's maxplayers.
